### GET request to all finds by user id
GET http://localhost:7070/api/v1/users/3/finds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### POST request to create new find
POST http://localhost:7070/api/v1/finds
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-10-20",
  "photoURL": "testbillede27",
  "note": "En flot sten.",
  "categoryIds": [4]
}

### PATCH request to update find
PATCH http://localhost:7070/api/v1/users/3/finds/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "DET HER ER EN FLOT STEN!"
}

### DELETE request to delete find
DELETE http://localhost:7070/api/v1/users/1/finds/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

